    "Saat belirleyen bir otomasyon ekleyince bug\u00fcn\u00fcn plan\u0131 burada listelenir.": "Dodajte automatizaciju sa vremenom i dana\u0161nji plan \u0107e biti prikazan ovdje.", // EN: Add an automation with a time and today's plan will be listed here.
