    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Pridru\u017ei se domu", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kada se ure\u0111aj uklju\u010di ili isklju\u010di", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Dodirnite ure\u0111aj da otvorite kontrolni ekran panela; on prikazuje samo funkcije koje taj ure\u0111aj podr\u017eava. Za Shelly, WLED i ESPHome ure\u0111aje, uklju\u010divanje/isklju\u010divanje i svjetlina idu direktno na ure\u0111aj.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
