    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ovaj 8-znamenkasti kod je za Apple HomeKit uparivanje i radi samo sa Apple Home aplikacijom. Ako ure\u0111aj podr\u017eava lokalni API kao \u0161to su Shelly, WLED ili Tasmota, mo\u017eete ga dodati sa va\u0161e lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ovaj QR kod pripada Wi-Fi mre\u017ei, a ne ure\u0111aju. Nakon \u0161to pove\u017eete ure\u0111aj na istu mre\u017eu, mo\u017eete ga dodati sa va\u0161e lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nijedan poznati NEXUS ure\u0111aj nije prona\u0111en na ovoj adresi. Provjerite da li je ure\u0111aj uklju\u010den i na istoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Kreirajte ovu pametnu aplikaciju:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Pripremamo predlo\u017eene funkcije za ovaj tok.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Sa\u010duvano ovaj mjesec", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Nijedan podr\u017eani ure\u0111aj nije prona\u0111en na ovoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Nijedan podr\u017eani ure\u0111aj nije prona\u0111en na ovoj mre\u017ei. Provjerite da li je ure\u0111aj uklju\u010den i povezan na isti Wi-Fi; u suprotnom, koristite katalog ispod ili QR / kod za postavljanje.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Lokalna za\u0161tita za ovaj ure\u0111aj", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj ne dijeli informacije o verziji", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj ili veza ne podr\u017eava baterijsku lampu.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj ne podr\u017eava automatsku lokaciju.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Ovaj kod za pozivnicu nije prona\u0111en.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Ovaj ekran grupira ure\u0111aje za osvjetljenje koje ste dodali po sobama; kada sa\u010duvate scenu, svjetlina i ton se postavljaju zajedno.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Ure\u0111aji koje dodate u ovaj dom su ovdje navedeni.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Ure\u0111aji koje dodate u ovaj dom su ovdje navedeni i povezani sa va\u0161im omiljenim karticama.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Da li ste sigurni da \u017eelite trajno izbrisati ovaj dom i sva njegova pode\u0161avanja?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ovaj kod nije podr\u017eani kod ure\u0111aja. Ako znate IP adresu ure\u0111aja, mo\u017eete ga dodati sa svoje lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Ovi brendovi se upravljaju preko va\u0161e lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Ova mini aplikacija je obezbije\u0111ena od strane zvani\u010dnog pru\u017eaoca usluga.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Ovo okru\u017eenje ne podr\u017eava pristup kameri.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
