    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Napravite aplikaciju za provjeru pri odlasku iz ku\u0107e koja prikazuje ure\u0111aje koji su uklju\u010deni, status zaklju\u010davanja i postavke energije na jednom ekranu. Dodajte tipke za brzo isklju\u010divanje i aktivaciju sigurnosti.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Provjerite ure\u0111aje koji su uklju\u010deni, zaklju\u010davanja i status energije u jednom toku prilikom napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Prika\u017ei ure\u0111aje koji su ostali upaljeni, status brave i energije na jednom ekranu prilikom napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e. Pogledajte svjetla, uti\u010dnice, klima ure\u0111aje i sigurnosne postavke koje su ostale uklju\u010dene prije nego \u0161to napustite ku\u0107u, na jednom panelu. Sakupite brze korake za isklju\u010divanje i aktiviranje sigurnosti u jedan tok. Napravimo zavr\u0161ne provjere prije nego \u0161to odete. Automatski isklju\u010dite svjetla nakon napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e. Automatski isklju\u010dite svjetla nakon \u0161to napustite ku\u0107u i uklju\u010dite ih kada se vratite. Automatski isklju\u010dite klima ure\u0111aj kada nema nikoga kod ku\u0107e i izbjegavajte nepotro\u0161nju energije. Automatski isklju\u010dite ure\u0111aje u re\u017eimu \u010dekanja u vremenu koje odaberete no\u0107u. Prilikom napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e. Isklju\u010dite uti\u010dnicu kada napu\u0161tate ku\u0107u. Napu\u0161tam ku\u0107u. Kod ku\u0107e sam. Dobrodo\u0161li ku\u0107i. Kada stignete ku\u0107i ili kada odlazite.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Prije odlaska od ku\u0107e na jednoj plo\u010di pogledaj svjetla, uti\u010dnice, klima-ure\u0111aje i sigurnosne postavke koji su ostali uklju\u010deni. Brzo isklju\u010divanje i aktivaciju sigurnosti objedini u jedan tijek.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Obavimo zavr\u0161ne provjere prije nego \u0161to ode\u0161.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Automatski ugasi svjetla nakon izlas...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Automatski ugasi svjetla nakon izlaska iz ku\u0107e", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Automatski ugasi svjetla nakon \u0161to iza\u0111e\u0161 i upali ih kad se vrati\u0161.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Automatski isklju\u010di klima-ure\u0111aj kad nikoga nema kod ku\u0107e i izbjegni nepotrebnu potro\u0161nju.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Automatski prekini napajanje ure\u0111ajima u stanju pripravnosti u vrijeme koje odabere\u0161 no\u0107u.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Pri izlasku iz ku\u0107e", // EN: When leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda prizi kapat": "Isklju\u010di uti\u010dnicu pri izlasku iz ku\u0107e", // EN: Turn off the plug when leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Izlazak iz ku\u0107e", // EN: Leaving home
    "Eve Geldim": "Kod ku\u0107e sam", // EN: I'm Home
