    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma ve ortak alan cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rlayan bir misafir modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Kar\u015f\u0131lama \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131, sessiz bildirim ve misafir eri\u015fim ad\u0131mlar\u0131 olsun.": "Kreiraj aplikaciju za gostinjski na\u010din koja priprema ulaz, rasvjetu i ure\u0111aje u zajedni\u010dkim prostorijama \u010dim gosti stignu. Uklju\u010di svjetlo dobrodo\u0161lice, tihe obavijesti i korake za pristup gostima.", // EN: Create a guest mode app that prepares the entrance, lighting and shared-area devices as soon as guests arrive. Include a welcome light, quiet notifications and guest access steps.
