    "\u00d6demeyi tamamlay\u0131nca bu sayfada kal; aboneli\u011fin hesab\u0131na yaz\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ostanite na ovoj stranici nakon \u0161to platite; pretplata se knji\u017ei na va\u0161 ra\u010dun.", // EN: Stay on this page after you pay; the subscription is written to your account.
    "\u0130ptal i\u00e7in \u00f6nce hesab\u0131nla giri\u015f yapmal\u0131s\u0131n.": "Prvo se prijavite na svoj ra\u010dun da biste otkazali.", // EN: Sign in with your account first to cancel.
    "\u0130ptal \u015fu an tamamlanamad\u0131. Biraz sonra yeniden dene.": "Otka\u017eivanje nije uspjelo. Poku\u0161ajte ponovo za trenutak.", // EN: Cancellation could not be completed. Try again in a moment.
