    "\u015eifreyi Kaydet": "Spasi lozinku", // EN: Save Password
    "Google ile giri\u015f \u015fu anda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor. E-posta ve \u015fifreyle giri\u015f yap; Google ile hesap a\u00e7t\u0131ysan \u201c\u015eifremi Unuttum\u201d ile bir \u015fifre belirleyebilirsin.": "Prijava preko Googlea trenutno nije dostupna. Prijavite se pomo\u0107u e-po\u0161te i lozinke; ako ste kreirali ra\u010dun preko Googlea, koristite \u201cZaboravljena lozinka\u201d da postavite lozinku.", // EN: Google sign-in isn't available right now. Sign in with email and password; if you created your account with Google, use “Forgot Password” to set a password.
