    "yukar\u0131daki hesap e-postas\u0131n\u0131": "gornja e-po\u0161ta ra\u010duna", // EN: the account email above
    "\u0130ptal ve \u00f6deme y\u00f6ntemi de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi g\u00fcvenli \u00f6deme sayfam\u0131z Whop \u00fczerinden yap\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ptal edersen mevcut d\u00f6nemin sonuna kadar kullanmaya devam edersin ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "Otkazivanje i promjena va\u0161eg na\u010dina pla\u0107anja odvija se na na\u0161oj sigurnoj stranici za naplatu, Whop. Ako otka\u017eete, i dalje koristite NEXUS+ do kraja teku\u0107eg perioda i sljede\u0107e pla\u0107anje nikada se ne vr\u0161i.", // EN: Cancelling and changing your payment method happen on our secure checkout page, Whop. If you cancel, you keep using NEXUS+ until the end of the current period and the next payment is never taken.
    "Aboneli\u011fin yok. NEXUS+ i\u00e7in Plus sayfas\u0131ndan \u00fccretsiz deneyebilirsin.": "Nemate pretplatu. Isprobajte NEXUS+ besplatno sa Plus stranice.", // EN: You don't have a subscription. Try NEXUS+ free from the Plus page.
    "QR, kurulum kodu veya manuel katalog ile ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Ure\u0111aji koje dodate putem QR, koda za postavljanje ili ru\u010dnog kataloga pojavljuju se ovdje.", // EN: Devices you add by QR, setup code or the manual catalog show up here.
