    "Kap\u0131 ve pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7\u0131k/kapal\u0131 durumu": "Kontrolna plo\u010da senzora vrata i prozora \u00b7 stanje otvoreno/zatvoreno", // EN: Door and window sensor panel · open/closed state
