    "Medya kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, ses, kanal": "Panel za kontrolu medija \u00b7 uklju\u010di, isklju\u010di, zvuk, kanal", // EN: Media control panel · on, off, volume, channel
    "Ev aletleri kontrol paneli \u00b7 ba\u015flat, durdur, program": "Panel za kontrolu ku\u0107nih aparata \u00b7 pokreni, zaustavi, program", // EN: Home appliance control panel · start, stop, program
    "\u0130klim kontrol paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem, mod": "Panel za kontrolu klime \u00b7 temperatura, vlaga, re\u017eim", // EN: Climate control panel · temperature, humidity, mode
    "Ortam sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, \u0131\u015f\u0131k, durum": "Panel za senzore okoline \u00b7 temperatura, svjetlost, status", // EN: Ambient sensor panel · temperature, light, status
    "Priz ve enerji kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, t\u00fcketim": "Panel za kontrolu uti\u010dnica i potro\u0161nje energije \u00b7 uklju\u010di, isklju\u010di, potro\u0161nja", // EN: Plug and energy control panel · on, off, consumption
    "Ula\u015f\u0131m ve takip paneli \u00b7 konum, \u015farj": "Panel za transport i pra\u0107enje \u00b7 lokacija, stanje napunjenosti", // EN: Transport and tracking panel · location, charge
    "A\u011f ge\u00e7idi paneli \u00b7 ba\u011flant\u0131, durum": "Panel za pristupnu ta\u010dku \u00b7 veza, status", // EN: Gateway panel · connection, status
    "Anahtar kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat": "Panel za kontrolu prekida\u010da \u00b7 uklju\u010di, isklju\u010di", // EN: Switch control panel · on, off
    "Bu ad ana sayfa kart\u0131nda ve cihaz listesinde g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Ovaj naziv se prikazuje na po\u010detnoj kartici i u listi ure\u0111aja.", // EN: This name shows on the home card and in the device list.
