    "Bu hesapta hen\u00fcz \u015fifre yok": "Ovaj nalog jo\u0161 nema lozinku", // EN: This account has no password yet
    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "Va\u0161a lozinka je postavljena \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Ovaj ra\u010dun je otvoren preko Googlea i jo\u0161 nema lozinku. Postavite svoju prvu lozinku ovdje; nakon toga se tako\u0111er mo\u017eete prijaviti pomo\u0107u emaila i lozinke.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Po\u0161aljite mi link za postavljanje lozinke", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "Ova radnja zahtijeva dodatnu verifikaciju. Mo\u017eete zatra\u017eiti link za postavljanje lozinke ispod.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Link za postavljanje lozinke poslan je u va\u0161 inbox \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "Link za lozinku trenutno ne mo\u017ee biti poslan.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "Nismo mogli prona\u0107i va\u0161 email za prijavu; prvo se prijavite.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "Link nije mogao biti poslan. Poku\u0161ajte ponovo za trenutak.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
