    "Hen\u00fcz do\u011frulanmad\u0131": "Jo\u0161 nije verifikovano", // EN: Not yet verified
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz ger\u00e7ek bir cihazla denenmedi.": "Ovaj tip veze jo\u0161 nije testiran sa stvarnim ure\u0111ajem.", // EN: This connection type has not been tested with a real device yet.
    "Uygulama \u0130\u00e7i Bildirim Sesi": "Zvuk obavijesti u aplikaciji", // EN: In-App Notification Sound
