    "Yedekle ve Geri Y\u00fckle": "Backup i Restore", // EN: Backup & Restore
    "Cihaz listesi, otomasyonlar, senaryolar ve ayarlar bir dosyaya kaydedilir. Cihaz parolalar\u0131, yerel anahtarlar, Telegram anahtar\u0131 ve oturum bilgisi yede\u011fe girmez.": "Va\u0161a lista ure\u0111aja, automatizacije, scene i pode\u0161avanja se \u010duvaju u datoteci. Lozinke ure\u0111aja, lokalni klju\u010devi, Telegram token i va\u0161a sesija nisu uklju\u010deni u backup.", // EN: Your device list, automations, scenes and settings are saved to a file. Device passwords, local keys, the Telegram token and your session are not included in the backup.
    "Yede\u011fi d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Izvezi backup", // EN: Export backup
    "Hata Raporu": "Izvje\u0161taj o gre\u0161ci", // EN: Error Report
    "Uygulamada olu\u015fan hatalar otomatik ve anonim olarak (ki\u015fisel veri olmadan) bize iletilir. \u0130stersen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan kapatabilirsin.": "Gre\u0161ke koje se pojavljuju u aplikaciji automatski i anonimno se \u0161alju nama (nema li\u010dnih podataka). Mo\u017eete ih isklju\u010diti dolje.", // EN: Errors that happen in the app are sent to us automatically and anonymously (no personal data). You can turn it off below.
    "Anonim Hata Raporu G\u00f6nder": "Po\u0161alji anonimne izvje\u0161taje o gre\u0161kama", // EN: Send Anonymous Error Reports
    "Anonim hata raporu g\u00f6nder": "Po\u0161alji anonimne izvje\u0161taje o gre\u0161kama", // EN: Send anonymous error reports
    "Yedekten geri y\u00fckle": "Vrati sa rezervne kopije", // EN: Restore from backup
    "E\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131na g\u00f6re haz\u0131r; tek dokunu\u015fla eklenir.": "Spremno za va\u0161e povezane ure\u0111aje; dodano jednim dodirom.", // EN: Ready for your paired devices; added with a single tap.
    "Senin i\u00e7in haz\u0131r": "Spremno za vas", // EN: Ready for you
