    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Ova veza je istekla ili je neva\u017ee\u0107a. Molimo poku\u0161ajte ponovo.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "Cloud ra\u010dun je onemogu\u0107en u ovoj verziji; lozinke lokalnih ra\u010duna ne mogu se resetovati.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Ako je ova adresa povezana s ra\u010dunom, link za resetovanje je poslan. Provjerite svoj inbox (i spam folder).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
