    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "Zadnjih 7 dana", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "Jo\u0161 ni\u0161ta nije izmjereno. Dodajte ure\u0111aj koji mjeri snagu i otvorite ovu stranicu; o\u010ditanja \u0107e se ovdje pojavljivati.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Intervali bez mjerenja se ne ra\u010dunaju, tako da vrijednosti mogu biti ni\u017ee od stvarne potro\u0161nje.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
