    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nije bilo mogu\u0107e povezati se na ure\u0111aj. Provjerite je li na istoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nije bilo mogu\u0107e povezati se na ure\u0111aj. Provjerite je li na istoj mre\u017ei i da su IP adresa i lokalni klju\u010d ispravni.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Uklju\u010duje svjetla u toploj boji, otvara zavjese i postavlja klima ure\u0111aj na 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Uklju\u010duje svjetla i otvara zavjese, pokre\u0107e klima ure\u0111aj na 22\u00b0 i \u0161alje usisiva\u010d na punjenje.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Gasi svjetla, TV i klima ure\u0111aj, zatvara zavjese i zaklju\u010dava vrata.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Gasi svjetla i TV, zatvara zavjese i zaklju\u010dava vrata.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Postavlja svjetla na toplu nijansu na 15%, zatvara zavjese i pali TV.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Zaklju\u010dava vrata i zatvara zavjese.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Uklju\u010duje svjetla na 70% svjetline.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Pokre\u0107e robotski usisiva\u010d.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 10:00": "Radni dani 10:00", // EN: Weekdays 10:00
    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Postavlja klima ure\u0111aj i termostat na udobno pode\u0161avanje i pokre\u0107e pro\u010di\u0161\u0107iva\u010d zraka.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "\u0160alje obavijest", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "Ovaj scenario ne uti\u010de na nijedan od va\u0161ih trenutnih ure\u0111aja. Da bi radilo, dodajte odgovaraju\u0107i ure\u0111aj (npr. svjetlo, zavjesu ili usisiva\u010d).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Napravite novi dom ili se pridru\u017eite jednom pomo\u0107u koda za pozivnicu koji vam je poslan.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "Niste prijavljeni. Domovi se \u010duvaju samo na ovom ure\u0111aju. Prijavite se da biste pozvali \u010dlanove, pridru\u017eili se domu i koristili poruke za porodicu.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
