    "Yerel \u015fifreli HTTP (KLAP) \u2014 TP-Link hesab\u0131 e-postas\u0131 + \u015fifresiyle, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller (kamera ve enerji \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm\u00fc hen\u00fcz yok)": "Lokalni enkriptovani HTTP (KLAP) \u2014 sa va\u0161im TP-Link nalogom (email + lozinka), u desktop aplikaciji; uti\u010dnice, prekida\u010di i sijalice (kamera i mjerenje potro\u0161nje energije jo\u0161 nisu dostupni)", // EN: Local encrypted HTTP (KLAP) — with your TP-Link account email + password, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs (camera and energy metering not available yet)
