    "Yerel LAN (3.3 / 3.4, \u015fifreli TCP) \u2014 \u00fccretsiz Tuya IoT hesab\u0131ndan al\u0131nan cihaz kimli\u011fi + yerel anahtarla, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller": "Lokalni LAN (3.3 / 3.4, enkriptovani TCP) \u2014 sa ID ure\u0111aja + lokalnim klju\u010dem sa besplatnog Tuya IoT naloga, u desktop aplikaciji; uti\u010dnice, prekida\u010di i sijalice", // EN: Local LAN (3.3 / 3.4, encrypted TCP) — with the device ID + local key from a free Tuya IoT account, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs
